+# Incident: Slow Product Listing Page
+
+## Description
+Users are reporting significant delays when attempting to view the main product listing page. The page takes an unusually long time to load, and in some cases, may appear unresponsive. This is impacting the overall user experience and potentially leading to abandoned sessions. Metrics show an increase in latency for requests to the `/products` endpoint.
